  "id": "iconicity",
  "term": "iconicity",
  "definition": "Iconicity is the property of a word or gesture in which its form resembles or vividly depicts its meaning, rather than being purely arbitrary. In learning and communication, iconic forms can support early language development, make meaning easier to grasp, and strengthen expressive interaction.",
